# Patch files are applied by `git apply` inside the fetched dependency trees,
# where the checked-out sources are LF (git inside the emscripten container has
# no autocrlf). On a Windows host with core.autocrlf=true a plain checkout
# rewrites them to CRLF, and the patch then fails to apply against LF sources -
# a fresh-clone failure with no local symptom, because a working tree that is
# never re-checked out keeps whatever bytes it was written with.
# `-text` disables EOL conversion for these files on every platform.
patches/*.patch -text
